Coralyn has sun-kissed brown skin, sharp elven features, and a lean, athletic frame built for stealth and endurance. Her dark brown hair falls in loose waves just past her shoulders, often windswept. Her eyes are a striking blend of green and amber, almost luminous in low light, reflecting a deep connection to the wilds. There is a faint scar along her left collarbone—wolf teeth, she claims, though she won’t say when or how.
